{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c6ad34f178156f21425e71ada625e675e21ad758f678e8a3abdfed5fc5803ebb", "ja": "黒井社長からの手紙。それは961プロ主催\nの大型フェスに、765プロから響、美希、\n貴音を招待するものだった。誘いに応じた\n彼らは、今回のために建設された最新鋭の\n施設、『アーク』の威容に目を見張る。", "zh": "这是黑井社长寄来的信。内容是邀请响、美希和贵音参加由961制作人主办的大型庆典，邀请方则是765制作人。他们接受邀请后，对为这次活动建造的最新设施“方舟”的壮观景象惊叹不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a908df2952e591e48bda234aa59effd9be571342d21495d207a58d6a3053e132", "ja": "（社長からの後押しもあり、招待された\n961プロ主催のフェス会場に赴くことにした）", "zh": "（在社长的支持下，决定前往受邀参加的由961事务所主办的音乐节会场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cec9389fbc593257c17b9ddb986b0756776e2dc4a3a85fcbed06933fc561200d", "ja": "色々と会場を下見してみたけど……\nこれはさすがに驚きだな……。", "zh": "我去各处把会场都提前看了一遍……不过这实在是让人吃惊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "145890bb0bdabf2d916d33ee11886568c17e0a57b0d25f9c2263d78076ddfdbd", "ja": "はい。まさか、今回のフェスのために\n会場施設を丸ごと建設していたとは……。", "zh": "是的。没想到竟然为了这次庆典，把整个会场设施都建起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "dfc054e4cd13548e1d5c1e4de06709b0c94ea0c58def452f3a04552feec6eaf4", "ja": "しかも、すっごくおっきいの。\n劇場10個ぶんくらいあるかも？", "zh": "而且，特别大。说不定有10个剧场那么大？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "e83a54dea684a8e23c9ecfe80ef6ee7e0e24c8ef73467c2187dbbfc81a27786e", "ja": "う……。み、みんな！\nこういう時、気持ちで負けちゃダメだからね！", "zh": "呜……大、大家！\n这种时候，可不能在气势上输掉哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "862c628c950f7fdc6798977ee0fe0f1341dd8ca75a5fdebb3c80cdee1f8bf459", "ja": "まだ勝っても負けてもないよ？\n響こそ、ちょっと緊張してる？", "zh": "还没分出胜负呢？\n倒是响，你是不是有点紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "8bcb384c21d1cfdd22ef0632b4462b72c1239b4fdc41fa57ef75066f40680e5e", "ja": "そ、そんなことないぞ！　自分たちは、\n765プロの代表だから、それだけ！", "zh": "才、才不是那回事！我们可是765Pro的代表，仅此而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "fad03bfac61be5a8e1ead7abbeaa4ad2ee40ea2cad7409f49dbf4755357a9e25", "ja": "ですが、身構えてしまうのもやむをえないかと。\n……本当に来てよろしかったのですか？", "zh": "不过，会有所戒备也是难免的。\n……真的可以来这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4e6855ae354e42a20570221ce815d8dd3db1bfbaadd25a438bd14380f4ae0a97", "ja": "今回のフェスは大規模だし、765プロ以外の\nアイドルも呼んでいるみたいなんだ。", "zh": "这次的庆典规模很大，除了765事务所的偶像以外，似乎也邀请了其他偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "46808d93437e9f4be1f8aa220b37fdedeb1df9370e0fde14e8aae45b6f0b6d8a", "ja": "表立って変なことはしてこないとは思う。\nそれに、俺も目を離さないつもりだし。", "zh": "我想他们应该不会明目张胆地做什么奇怪的事。而且，我也打算一直盯着他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1010_kuroi", "source_sha256": "c51424690b7f1209af6e866f154816f13283f4017a0052ebeafc60c0f0e8476b", "ja": "フン！　招いてやれば早速陰口か。\nいかにも底辺プロダクションらしい振る舞いだな！", "zh": "哼！才邀请你们，就马上在背后说坏话吗。  \n真是一副不入流事务所的作风啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "464006126f008c917a05c374db647bad63b453d5ba5a41b0ffeaf8a7bfb572e7", "ja": "黒井社長！", "zh": "黑井社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "7007599076ebe2ef2b833c4abb6811c60a486b757334b6ec1bc1aa1e6f68a96b", "ja": "あ、ミキのこと引き抜こうとした黒いおじさん。", "zh": "啊，就是那个想把美希挖走的黑脸大叔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "2438705aa4232bd1f197eaadb1b1b3f7f02a8a3cc5aed9492b8880e2993555d1", "ja": "あの後も、劇場のみんなにイジワルしてるでしょ？\nそういうの、ミキよくないって思うな。", "zh": "在那之后，你也在使坏欺负剧场的大家吧？\n美希觉得，这样很不好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "208806f1163dcc204d42366d4b21ca25f3bcc02d260045e775040bd56507abac", "ja": "何やら機材に細工をされたとも聞いています。\n卑怯千万この上ない所業かと。", "zh": "我还听说，设备似乎也被人动了手脚。实在是卑鄙至极的行径。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1015_kuroi", "source_sha256": "7b7215c26598b5f27d2735b120bd868bce972ed8fe3edf8e8f310fd83a44ac00", "ja": "そんなことは知らん、記憶にない！　いつまでも、\n細かいことをネチネチと。じつに執念深い連中だな！", "zh": "我不知道那种事，也不记得！没完没了地纠结那些细枝末节。真是一群执着得可怕的家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "83e5784916fb34caf73c46ec74a96fb2fe48bb02dfa53c16e68f67d54d245ddc", "ja": "黒井社長にだけは言われたくないぞ……。", "zh": "唯独不想听黑井社长这么说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4d6b8403aec4356c935a6fae72143e9e81c4265add00a5a5463a1e5a27a32d25", "ja": "ええと、黒井社長。この度はご招待にあずかり\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "那个……黑井社长。感谢您这次邀请我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d2a74bcc4c1238128ef16bf4f39aab2d93ce944eae579cb5421bf7b3ed5bfa9a", "ja": "ただ……これは本当にただのフェスですか？\nいくらなんでも規模が大きすぎるような……。", "zh": "但是……这真的只是普通的庆典吗？\n不管怎么说，规模也未免太大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1019_kuroi", "source_sha256": "70117eadf15d573ffe51c9af8ca8c41a2d20fe76d9e8d5e9ea45553ccba7dec4", "ja": "ほう。そのミジンコ並みの脳みそでも、さすがに\n気付いたか。よかろう、特別に教えてやる！", "zh": "哦。就凭你那和水蚤差不多大的脑子，居然也终于注意到了啊。好吧，特别告诉你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1020_kuroi", "source_sha256": "3c2bc7625aff6f5862f2cdbf9114cc78036fef085c5a9013cd8f48018f1afbec", "ja": "この計画はレーベルを超えた巨大な『アーク』……\n今回のフェスはその先駆けに過ぎない。", "zh": "这个计划，是一个超越各大厂牌的巨大『アーク』……\n这次的庆典不过是它的先声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "346262aba55db685e3fb621477ab08d110942360081e3ca0de867adb49519c55", "ja": "『アーク』……。", "zh": "『方舟』……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1022_kuroi", "source_sha256": "8aa87a80f65e22974fb755194d993b4b6a028929eb75efeab578b97ef8c091c1", "ja": "『アーク』とは輝ける星々の箱舟……新たなる時代へと\n漕ぎ出す、選ばれた者たちのゆりかごとなるのだ！", "zh": "所谓“方舟”，即是闪耀群星的方舟……它将成为\n驶向新时代的天选之人们的摇篮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1023_kuroi", "source_sha256": "3ff6fe17ebe1b9b6c7fac85f9affac11fca427bd1d3862d8554151466b782d13", "ja": "楽曲もスタッフも設備も超一流！　この会場施設には\nトップアイドルになるための全てが揃っている！", "zh": "无论是歌曲、工作人员还是设备，都是顶尖水准！这座会场设施里，成为顶级偶像所需的一切应有尽有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "42d25e37cf605999efe399e323997ef60ca1cb769599a9cd91821cf691405137", "ja": "それは……\nこの規模を見るに、説得力がありますね。", "zh": "确实……\n从这个规模来看，很有说服力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1025_kuroi", "source_sha256": "ccbecf99afbd3ed0005c9b8965a6ac63106f373a3d681c11a6c63e44721fa9c2", "ja": "当然だ。今回のフェスによって、961プロの理想を\nより強く世に知らしめるのだからな。", "zh": "那是当然。毕竟要通过这次的音乐节，\n让世人更深刻地体会到961事务所的理想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1026_kuroi", "source_sha256": "08fbf1e7d5a5605ebd4830f985b2131fe7e758a08ac117a6c02e87c015691279", "ja": "貴様らも準備期間は『アーク』に身を置くがいい。\n特別に！　この超一流の環境を提供してやろう！", "zh": "你们在准备期间也给我待在『方舟』里吧。\n特别允许你们使用这个超一流的环境！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "7ea292e4e2e8f0f5073c9c3e448d4e930781e1509628010480ad37cdae527882", "ja": "しばらくここを使っていいってこと……？\n今度はなにを企んでるんだ……！？", "zh": "意思是可以暂时用这里……？\n这次又在打什么主意……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "94192e54b771b433e471f3686eca8a0c1044c041cf9722901cbebf52066b8e59", "ja": "響、落ち着くのです。まずはうぇるかむすいーつを\n味わってからでも遅くはないはず……。", "zh": "响，冷静下来。先尝尝迎宾甜点再说，也不迟……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "ec281753eb74898f1322ac5e142feb6db8e8388dc5316ea2c57db4d5f47fe3cf", "ja": "あ、ミキもお昼寝専用のお部屋が気になってたの！\nとってもいいカンジで、思い出しただけで……あふぅ。", "zh": "啊，美希也很在意那个专门用来午睡的房间呢！\n感觉特别棒，光是想起来就……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "b069697f71d1ca2cd868b224fa6d94338e5c480fc6b2690a0a12c3631f417c72", "ja": "そういえばアメニティも豊富だったな。\n持って帰りたいくらいに……。", "zh": "说起来，这里的用品也很丰富啊。丰富到都想带回家了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1031_kuroi", "source_sha256": "8b07b0b52668f110d35e1d479ab5a2369dbc87d16e874b2431a8414aad1242f4", "ja": "ええい、この施設を見て思うことはそれだけか！\nこの凡俗カルテットめ！　……まあいい。", "zh": "不，不对，看到这个设施，你想到的就只有这些吗！\n你们这群凡庸的四人组！……不过，算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1032_kuroi", "source_sha256": "0e112ff2575e94ab113a271050c98718bcb8fada3f05944d089098993dd3fe69", "ja": "『アーク』に触れればわかることだ。961プロこそが\n唯一トップアイドルへと至る道であることがな！", "zh": "只要接触过“方舟”就会明白。唯有961事务所，\n才是通往顶尖偶像的唯一途径！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1033_kuroi", "source_sha256": "5c21e3b4e88800e15015f48017b615c2ba727a4540e64c84fe0ea278b0b0c43a", "ja": "フェス本番、私の言葉の正しさを思い知るだろう！\nでは、アデュー！　ハァーッハッハッハ！！", "zh": "到了庆典正式开始时，你就会知道我说得没错了！\n\n那么，告辞！哈哈哈哈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "53956d12322ee3f60d3d75cd764033c5f32ddfa13bd46f40f606ff9402c2deb3", "ja": "行っちゃった……。なんかいろいろ言ってたけど\n要するに、相変わらずだったよね？", "zh": "走了……她说了好多，但归根结底，还是老样子吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "7520a5593e7b2b240f4082cf8f461130695b28e23cd2a627acebb4453af259a5", "ja": "そうだな。でも、本当に妨害とかもなさそうだ。\n意外というか、拍子抜けというか……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，看起来这次真的没有什么阻挠。\n该说是意外呢，还是有点扫兴……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a7e899c24d417f9337416232338abcbd0cdac082c2a4b91f68347c368d0f4c91", "ja": "それだけ今回の『アーク』というものに\n本気ということなのか……。", "zh": "也就是说，这次对所谓『方舟』是认真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "16ce5213f901327f19b09181ac8b3433305a461a7e6b653d3d2178b00d3e1ff7", "ja": "変なコトしてこないなら、\n気にし過ぎても仕方ないって思うな。", "zh": "只要对方不搞什么小动作，\n美希觉得就算太在意也没用呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1038_008tak", "source_sha256": "fd1cc453b67f1c40a7e3602d7690950a9b2b380f15321598ce7c6cd108d66c0e", "ja": "そうですね。厚意は素直に受け取るといたしましょう。\nでは、後ほど……。", "zh": "是的。既然是好意，我们就坦率地接受吧。\n那么，稍后再见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "25978170e0b6828b4a8d5ad6479736c709a46e4ae49f54e07b22b0cc1b9e0e05", "ja": "あ、二人ともズルいぞ！　自分も行くってば～！\nたしか、シークヮーサーソーダあったよね♪", "zh": "啊，你们两个太狡猾了！我也要去啦～！\n我记得，这里有冲绳香檬苏打吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a7bfa5e793dd3868e571f1e87d49ae3d9e1d3f903d8ad7114320670d816a3a53", "ja": "（招待されたフェスにこの施設……\n怪しさはどうしても感じるんだけど……）", "zh": "（受邀参加的庆典，还有这个设施……无论如何都让人觉得有些可疑，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0408_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0408_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "2df962d72454775e08cf28bf89e92d3ba57d12aa49fc48a0b3574ad2eb8718ed", "ja": "（現段階ではなにもないのは事実。\nひとまずは様子を見ることにしよう）", "zh": "（至少目前确实什么都没有。先静观其变吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
